before the approaching darkness consumes everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MAGIC WILL CHANGE YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic is more than a collection of weapons you are used to. It shapes the way you fight, determines how your character develops, and gradually transforms your physical appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>12 schools of magic</strong>, learn new spells, improve their power, and experiment with combinations drawn from different magical disciplines. Specialise in a carefully selected group of schools or mix seemingly incompatible powers to create a build of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every choice leaves its mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/bd48741ec53c976f11664108170e1d58.poster.avif?t=1791364709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/bd48741ec53c976f11664108170e1d58.webm?t=1791364709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/bd48741ec53c976f11664108170e1d58.mp4?t=1791364709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your mastery grows, magical energy begins to alter your body. New features, mutations, and supernatural traits reveal the powers you have embraced, turning your character into a visible reflection of the magic they command.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN SCHOOL OF DESTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magic system lies at the heart of <strong>Dawn of Magic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each school offers its own spells, tactical possibilities, and visual transformations. Magical disciplines can be developed individually, but their true potential emerges when their effects are combined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/18d99d4050e9e27604b7ec12f8d601a6.poster.avif?t=1791364709\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/18d99d4050e9e27604b7ec12f8d601a6.webm?t=1791364709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33540/extras/18d99d4050e9e27604b7ec12f8d601a6.mp4?t=1791364709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn enemies with destructive forces, summon supernatural creatures, weaken resistance, control the battlefield, protect yourself with magical barriers, or enhance your abilities before entering close combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experimentation is essential. A spell that appears modest on its own may become devastating when supported by another school, the right equipment, or a carefully planned character build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinctive spell-driven action RPG focused on experimentation and character building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 schools of magic, each offering different spells, effects, and tactical possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical disciplines to create specialized or hybrid character builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible magical transformations that alter your hero’s appearance as their powers develop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters, each offering a different starting point for the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different paths through the story, shaped by the hero you choose and the decisions you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat combining spells, weapons, equipment, and character abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of enemies, including hostile mages, monsters, summoned creatures, and powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual fantasy world filled with quests, settlements, ruins, dungeons, and supernatural threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original version of the game, preserved in its authentic form</p></li></ul>",
