                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After spending some time trying to get this game to run on Windows 10, it is more so a labor of love to do so. As promising as this game can be, getting past the intro creation screen is the game in a whole for my own personal experience. With constant Direct X errors out the wazoo. Having to fiddle with DGvoodoo2 to try to get it to run past fill in the blank here, it is a nightmare to play on a modern PC unless you have a good luck charm in your back pocket. I would suggest playing this on a older machine if you own one, or waiting for a patch roll out to fix pristine any issues across the way for this game. As It was one I was very excited for to play in general. It could be cured with a VM/possibility a wrapper, but to buy something from a store front you expect not to have to. When I see it fixed or a solution is brought to light I would rate this higher.",
